@fentasyl Yeah, the “labs” term makes no sense. They are for-profit corporations. 

Any entity that reports quarterly earnings per share is obviously not a “lab”! 

They may own labs, but they also have large enterprise sales teams generating billions of dollars in revenue.

@DirtyTesLa We cut our RAM in half for the Tesla AI5 chip (now 72GB of LP5) and 1/3 for AI6 (now 144GB of LP6). 

This was the only way to get enough volume for Optimus production and greatly reduces cost. 

As it turns out, we think this will have a negligible effect on Optimus performance,
